# Archivo de pruebas para la API de Restaurantes
# Usar con herramientas como Thunder Client, Postman o similar

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Obtener todos los restaurantes (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants

### 2. Obtener restaurantes cercanos (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants?latitude=-16.4040102&longitude=-71.559611&radius=10

### 3. Obtener detalles de un restaurante (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here

### 4. Obtener menú de un restaurante (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here/menu

### 5. Obtener todas las categorías (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/categories/all

### 6. Crear categorías por defecto (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/categories/seed
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Crear una nueva categoría (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comida Peruana",
  "description": "Restaurantes especializados en comida tradicional peruana"
}

### 8. Crear un nuevo restaurante (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurants
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chez Pierre",
  "address": "Av. El Sol 456, Cusco",
  "phone": "+51984123456",
  "latitude": -13.5164,
  "longitude": -71.9785,
  "categoryId": "category-uuid-here",
  "ownerId": "user-uuid-here"
}

### 9. Actualizar un restaurante (ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chez Pierre - Restaurante Francés",
  "phone": "+51984999888"
}

### 10. Crear un item de menú (ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Coq au Vin",
  "description": "Pollo guisado en vino tinto con verduras",
  "price": 45.00,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/coq-au-vin.jpg",
  "categoryId": "category-uuid-here"
}

### 11. Obtener un item específico del menú (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here/menu/menu-item-uuid-here

### 12. Actualizar un item de menú (ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here/menu/menu-item-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 48.00,
  "description": "Pollo guisado en vino tinto francés con verduras frescas"
}

### 13. Eliminar un item de menú (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here/menu/menu-item-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Eliminar un restaurante (ADMIN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/restaurant-uuid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
### Ejemplos de respuestas esperadas:
###

